# Tool Call Format Rules

DO NOT output DSML blocks like `<|DSML|tool_calls>` or `<|DSML|invoke>`.
DO NOT use `<|DSML|parameter>` tags.

You MUST strictly use XML-style tags to invoke tools, with this exact format:

<read_file>
<path>path/to/file</path>
</read_file>

<write_to_file>
<path>path/to/file</path>
<content>file content here</content>
</write_to_file>

<list_files>
<path>path/to/directory</path>
<recursive>true</recursive>
</list_files>

<search_files>
<path>path/to/directory</path>
<regex>search pattern</regex>
<file_pattern>*.cpp</file_pattern>
</search_files>

<execute_command>
<command>your command here</command>
<requires_approval>true</requires_approval>
</execute_command>